---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PhotoCard from '../components/PhotoCard.astro';
import { HOME_TITLE } from '../consts';
import sky1 from '../assets/images/sky1.jpeg';
import sky2 from '../assets/images/sky2.jpeg';
import dorm1 from '../assets/images/dorm1.jpeg';
import random1 from '../assets/images/random1.jpeg';
---

<BaseLayout title={HOME_TITLE}>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1 class="hero__title">
        About <span class="hero__title-accent">Me!</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero__name">
        Mazen Ragab aka <span class="accent">(Maztardoo)</span>
      </p>
      <div class="hero__bio">
        <p>
          Hi, you already know my name! I am currently a G12 student at New Cairo STEM School. Even
          though I am G12, I am 16 years old, which is kinda dope ngl cuz I feel superior lol.
        </p>
        <p>
          A fun fact about me is that I am trying to be a Polymath. I am into multiple stuff. I am
          into Tech, Marketing, Psychology and Human Behaviour, Business, and honestly a lot of
          other random things that I find interesting. I really enjoy learning about things outside
          of what I am supposed to know, especially when I can connect different fields together and
          use them to create something.
        </p>
        <p>
          I don't really want to limit myself to one specific field or career. I want to explore as
          much as I can, build things, understand people, learn how businesses work, and develop
          skills that complement each other. I think the most interesting ideas usually happen when
          you combine knowledge from completely different areas.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside of academics, I am also really into building projects and experimenting with
          ideas. I enjoy taking an idea that sounds stupid at first and trying to turn it into
          something real. I am especially interested in AI, entrepreneurship, and using technology
          to solve actual problems.
        </p>
        <p>
          Overall, I would say I am just extremely curious. I like going down random rabbit holes,
          learning things that have absolutely nothing to do with school, and then somehow finding a
          way to connect them back to something useful. My goal is basically to become the type of
          person who can walk into almost any conversation and have something interesting to
          contribute.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="pics" aria-labelledby="pics-title">
      <h2 class="section__title" id="pics-title">
        Random Pics in my <em>life</em>
      </h2>
      <ul class="card-grid">
        <li>
          <PhotoCard
            image={sky1}
            alt="Night sky with a bright moon behind dark leaves"
            title="A random sky Image I took"
          >
            Fun Fact! This is one of the first images I took with my new phone.
          </PhotoCard>
        </li>
        <li>
          <PhotoCard
            image={sky2}
            alt="Dark green leaves against a night sky"
            title="A random sky Image I took"
          >
            I post these pics on{' '}
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/papisartisticgarden/">@papisartisticgarden</a>.
          </PhotoCard>
        </li>
        <li>
          <PhotoCard
            image={dorm1}
            alt="Lit dormitory hallway with tiled walls and doors"
            title="Walking down the dorms"
          >
            Nothing <em>crazy</em> I was just walking and took a pic 🤑
          </PhotoCard>
        </li>
        <li>
          <PhotoCard
            image={random1}
            alt="Streetlight glowing over palm leaves at night"
            title="OMG"
          >
            Was with a couple of my friends and just wanted to take a pic BOOM.
          </PhotoCard>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
